---
description: Render and check commands for the cookiecutter template
globs: ["cookiecutter.json", "hooks/*.py", "**/Makefile", "**/*.toml", "**/*.md"]
---

# Commands

- Render one combo: `uvx cookiecutter --no-input -o /tmp/opencode/out . use_analytics=y use_agent_instructions=y`
- Render full matrix: `use_analytics` in `y n` × `use_agent_instructions` in `y n`
- Check a rendered dir: `make build check_format` then `uv build`
- Lint hooks: `uvx ruff check hooks/`
